Okay, okay, it's fine.

672
00:46:26,072 --> 00:46:28,072
そしたらー、一旦こう...
Then, for now...

673
00:46:28,072 --> 00:46:30,072
ラオラ、ナンパしてたなー
Raora was hitting on someone~

674
00:46:30,072 --> 00:46:32,072
みんなの声聞こえない
I can't hear anyone's voice.

675
