I blocked them.

688
00:47:18,572 --> 00:47:21,272
えっと、イナ... あの、行けた？
Umm, Ina... Were you able to do it?

689
00:47:22,072 --> 00:47:25,572
なんかメニューとか出なくて...
Nothing like a menu pops up...

690
00:47:29,072 --> 00:47:30,872
